flowchart TD
    A[Order SUBMITTED, approvalStatus PENDING] --> B["Approval queue /orders/approval - oldest first"]
    B --> C["Review order /orders/approval/:id"]
    C --> D[System runs getApprovalChecks]
    D --> E{Any blocking check failed?}
    E -->|Yes| F["Approve disabled: Cannot approve - customer inactive / hub inactive / products inactive / total invalid / credit if blocking on"]
    F --> G{Manager action}
    E -->|No| G
    G -->|Approve| H{Warnings - credit or stock?}
    H -->|Yes, not acknowledged| H1[Confirm that you have reviewed the credit and stock warnings] --> G
    H -->|None or acknowledged| R{Remarks required by settings?}
    R -->|Yes and empty| R1[Approval remarks are required] --> G
    R -->|OK| APP[APPROVED - consolidation PENDING]
    APP --> N1[Notify salesman + Customer Service, event ORDER_APPROVED]
    G -->|Return for correction| RT{Reason from list + remarks?}
    RT -->|No| RT1[Validation error] --> G
    RT -->|Yes| RET[RETURNED]
    RET --> N2[Notify salesman with link to edit - section highlighted]
    N2 --> RS[Salesman corrects and resubmits] --> A
    G -->|Reject| RJ{Reason from list + remarks?}
    RJ -->|No| RT1
    RJ -->|Yes| REJ([REJECTED - final])
    REJ --> N3[Notify salesman, event ORDER_REJECTED]
